### Rule summary (intended page content)

- **Purpose:** Visible data tables must expose programmatic header relationships via `<th scope="…">` or `headers` on every `<td>`.
- **Pass:** `render_table` / `controls.py` patterns; layout tables with `role="presentation"` excluded.
- **Fail:** `surfaces.py`-style unscoped `<th>`; grids with no `<th>` and no `headers`; widget tables missing scope after hydration.
- **Remediate:** Prefer `render_table`; add `scope="col"`; or wire `headers`; re-run `tableHeadersReport`.

